{"content":[{"c":["SHUPPIM"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Son of Ir and a great-grandson of Benjamin (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.12","r":"1Chr.7.12","rawR":"1Chr.7.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.12","value":"1Chr.7.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:12"},"). Shuppim is perhaps a shortened form of Shephupham (Shupham), mentioned in ",{"href":"?bref=Num.26.39","r":"Num.26.39","rawR":"Num.26.39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.26.39","value":"Num.26.39"}],"t":"ref","v":"Numbers 26:39"}," as the son of Benjamin. It could also be an alternate spelling for Muppim (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.46.21","r":"Gen.46.21","rawR":"Gen.46.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.46.21","value":"Gen.46.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gen 46:21"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Shephupham_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Shephupham_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Shephupham_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Shephupham"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Levite gatekeeper, who, with Hosah, watched the gate of Shallecheth on the western side of Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.26.16","r":"1Chr.26.16","rawR":"1Chr.26.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.26.16","value":"1Chr.26.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 26:16"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Shuppim","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 7:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.12","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.12","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.12"},{"anchorText":"Numbers 26:39","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.26.39","rawQueryValue":"Num.26.39","sourceRefExact":"Num.26.39"},{"anchorText":"Gen 46:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.46.21","rawQueryValue":"Gen.46.21","sour